        "Abstract": "The paper describes a Jeopardy!-like Russian QA dataset collected from the official Russian quiz database Chgk che-ge-\u2018ka:. The data set includes 379,284 quiz-like questions with 29,375 from the Russian analogue of Jeopardy! \u2013 \u201cOwn Game\u201d. The authors observe its linguistic features and the related QA-task and conclude about perspectives of a QA challenge based on the collected dataset."
